#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:1
msgid "Connector"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:3
msgid ""
"Undici creates the underlying socket via the connector builder. Normally,"
" this happens automatically and you don't need to care about this, but if"
" you need to perform some additional check over the currently used "
"socket, this is the right place."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:8
msgid ""
"If you want to create a custom connector, you must import the "
"`buildConnector` utility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:10
msgid "Parameter: `buildConnector.BuildOptions`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:12
msgid ""
"Every Tls option, see "
"[here](https://nodejs.org/api/tls.html#tls_tls_connect_options_callback)."
" Furthermore, the following options can be passed:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:15
msgid ""
"**socketPath** `string | null` (optional) - Default: `null` - An IPC "
"endpoint, either Unix domain socket or Windows named pipe."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:16
msgid ""
"**maxCachedSessions** `number | null` (optional) - Default: `100` - "
"Maximum number of TLS cached sessions. Use 0 to disable TLS session "
"caching. Default: `100`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:17
msgid "**timeout** `number | null` (optional) -  In milliseconds. Default `10e3`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:18
msgid "**servername** `string | null` (optional)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:20
msgid ""
"Once you call `buildConnector`, it will return a connector function, "
"which takes the following parameters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:22
msgid "Parameter: `connector.Options`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:24
msgid "**hostname** `string` (required)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:25
msgid "**host** `string` (optional)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:26
msgid "**protocol** `string` (required)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:27
msgid "**port** `string` (required)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:28
msgid "**servername** `string` (optional)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:29
msgid ""
"**localAddress** `string | null` (optional) Local address the socket "
"should connect from."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Connector.md:30
msgid ""
"**httpSocket** `Socket` (optional) Establish secure connection on a given"
" socket rather than creating a new socket. It can only be sent on TLS "
"update."
msgstr ""

